>Haz</span><span class=\"v\">Punta hacia la espinilla (dorsiflexión) y punta abajo (plantiflexión).</span></div><div class=\"fr\"><span class=\"k\">Mide</span><span class=\"v\">Dorsiflexión <b>0–20°</b> · Plantiflexión <b>0–50°</b>.</span></div><div class=\"ojo\"><b>👁️ Ojo</b> Rango chico: que el pie se vea <b>completo y nítido</b>, sin tela ni calcetín.</div></div></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"med-rom\">🦾 ROM de brazos <span class=\"s\">— barrido rápido (codo, hombro, cuello)</span></h2>\n<div class=\"note\"><b>Qué es.</b> Un <b>barrido rápido</b>: 2–3 reps lentas. Es <b>menos fino</b> que el goniómetro y descarta la medición si la <b>visibilidad es &lt;25%</b>. Para un número fino de codo u hombro, usa el <b>📐 Goniómetro</b>.</div>\n<div class=\"rc\"><div class=\"rc-e\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 190 150\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:190px;height:auto\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"188\" height=\"148\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#F7F9FC\" stroke=\"#e5e9f0\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"122\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"122\" stroke=\"#d3dae6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"66\" cy=\"26\" r=\"8.5\" fill=\"#e7edf6\" stroke=\"#33415c\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><line x1=\"66\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"66\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#33415c\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"66\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#33415c\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"66\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"72\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#33415c\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"66\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"66\" y2=\"66\" stroke=\"#33415c\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"66\" y1=\"66\" x2=\"84\" y2=\"52\" stroke=\"#33415c\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"66\" cy=\"40\" r=\"3.4\" fill=\"#1B3A6B\"/><circle cx=\"66\" cy=\"66\" r=\"3.4\" fill=\"#1B3A6B\"/><circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"52\" r=\"3.4\" fill=\"#1B3A6B\"/><path d=\"M 66.0 83.0 A 17 17 0 0 0 82.2 60.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C8A24B\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"82